  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div><ix:continuation id="F_c0204214-119e-4cf1-a035-6e3708e98322_4" continuedAt="F_c0204214-119e-4cf1-a035-6e3708e98322_5"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;text-decoration:underline solid;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Restricted Stock Units</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The Company recognizes stock-based compensation for restricted stock units over the vesting period based on the fair market value of the stock on the date of the award, calculated as the average of the high and low trading prices for the Company&#8217;s Common Stock on the award date. </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_52583b4b-da5c-4585-a84c-895c99f7fd4c_2" continuedAt="F_52583b4b-da5c-4585-a84c-895c99f7fd4c_3"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">A summary of the Company&#8217;s non-vested restricted stock units as of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">December 31, 2025 and 2024, and changes during the years then ended is presented below:</span></ix:continuation></span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_52583b4b-da5c-458